WEBVTT

00:00:00.100 --> 00:00:02.140
Hey kids — have you heard about this place?

00:00:02.290 --> 00:00:05.110
The president's house has stood here since eighteen hundred.

00:00:06.160 --> 00:00:08.760
Look! The fountain is sparkling in the garden!

00:00:08.910 --> 00:00:09.890
And quiet again.
